                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panen, go eno bino gi pondeponde! Aka kisi waŋ dhano bino neno go, kiri joma jocwowo go je. Ji je ma piny jobino ywak kwoŋbedo go. Apaka bino bedo! Ameno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
